  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/348126/Spheres-Apocrypha-Radiant-and-Righteous?affiliate_id=549120\">Spheres Apocrypha: Radiant and Righteous</a></sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Protection sphere, Warleader sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When creating or while concentrating on a ward, you may expend your martial focus to apply the benefits of a (shout) or (tactic) talent you possess to all allies in the area of the ward for 1 round. When you create a ward, you gain a bonus to your caster level equal to half the number of ranks you have in the Diplomacy skill, rounded up, when determining the effects of your ward ability. This cannot increase your caster level above your Hit Dice.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/champion-feats#toc116\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
